        "description": "Look at a port overview, RTG, trolley, spreader, bay, STS crane or current task. For looking straight down at the spreader and container tops from BELOW the trolley platform, use target=trolley and view=under_trolley: a wide 110-degree camera that follows the trolley by default. This differs from the external top view above the RTG. Increase field_of_view_deg to widen the view without moving the camera. Other views support custom angles, distance and following a moving target. Changes only the viewport.",
